<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95815" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπείρ-ᾱμα</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπείρ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>coil, convolution</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχίδνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					248
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					843a32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.972f
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. περισφυρίοιο
			δράκοντος</span>, of a serpent-shaped ornament, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.207
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰῶνος σπειρήματα</span>”
				<i>periods, cycles,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.Anth.
					3.186
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάργανον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				417
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>twisted thread</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήρυμα</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>rolled bandage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).788
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				809
			</span></i>, al.</div>
